        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/fb65314fb9ca363251f1b28086e0fd70.webp?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered what it would be like to become a little cat chasing a ball of yarn in a dream?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now you can experience it for yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this maddening journey, you control a determined little cat, pushing the yarn all the way up toward the clouds. Sounds simple, right? Wrong. Every step is a struggle, every collision matters, and even the smallest mistake will send the yarn rolling back to the starting point. The only things you can rely on are your paws—left, right, or both together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/5d47fbb20be05a42681b02e68a647bee.poster.avif?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/5d47fbb20be05a42681b02e68a647bee.webm?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/5d47fbb20be05a42681b02e68a647bee.mp4?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/0a47d865a384cdf35b0b3f324c26096f.webp?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ll need to traverse semi-realistic, complex paths: squeeze through narrow obstacles, balance on constantly shifting terrain, and struggle in the water, where controlling the cat becomes nearly impossible. Though there are safe zones in each stage, reaching them is a battle of its own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/cd694cfff54151275b6d2318fc4316fd.poster.avif?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/cd694cfff54151275b6d2318fc4316fd.webm?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/cd694cfff54151275b6d2318fc4316fd.mp4?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/fb65314fb9ca363251f1b28086e0fd70.webp?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op Mode — suffer together</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/7a51bdfe1c1e7b58708cd3b429194f1f.poster.avif?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/7a51bdfe1c1e7b58708cd3b429194f1f.webm?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/7a51bdfe1c1e7b58708cd3b429194f1f.mp4?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/0a47d865a384cdf35b0b3f324c26096f.webp?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s unique. It’s punishing. It’s super adorable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because this isn’t just another rage game—it’s the world’s first cat-and-yarn rage climb. No matter how many times you fall, you’ll always find yourself saying: “Just one more try.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/646b3d2fc69be39fc2da2f8fabe67137.poster.avif?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/646b3d2fc69be39fc2da2f8fabe67137.webm?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/646b3d2fc69be39fc2da2f8fabe67137.mp4?t=1765688894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937150/extras/0a47d865a384cdf35b0b3f324c26096f.webp?t=1765688894\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p>",
